---
/**
 * The sentence under the page title.
 *
 * A `<div>` rather than a `<p>`, because the markdown inside a slot compiles to
 * its own `<p>` — and a `<p>` inside a `<p>` is not nesting the HTML parser
 * allows. It silently closes the outer one, which leaves the class on an empty
 * element and the text unstyled beside it.
 */
---

<div class="page-lede"><slot /></div>
